### REST Client file (VS Code). Sign in first; the token is then reused below.
@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana", "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "Password123" }

### Login (the token is saved in the variable `token`)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "Password123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My jobs (search, filter, page)
GET {{base}}/jobs?q=bank&status=applied&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a job
POST {{base}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "company": "Acme Logistics", "role": "Dispatcher", "status": "applied" }

### Stats
GET {{base}}/jobs/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without a token (expect 401)
GET {{base}}/jobs
